        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "NDT 1"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Mist marks the NDT debut by the Belgian-French choreographer Damien Jalet, whose creations tend to be visually stunning, kinetic, and thought provoking. Jalet created Mist, a multidisciplinary dance film, in close collaboration with Japanese visual artist Kohei Nawa and videographer Rahi Rezvani.  Metaphoric and metamorphic, Mist was created in the midst of the COVID19 pandemic and captures a sense of&hellip;"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-06-28T17:00:00"
      }
    ]
  },
